      "summary": "A lookup table for the settings that change behaviour, security or deployment. Defaults are not repeated; this is the map of what to set and why.",
      "quick_answer": "Keep `SECRET_KEY`, `DEBUG`, `ALLOWED_HOSTS` and database credentials in the environment. Set `AUTH_USER_MODEL` before the first migration. Treat `SECURE_*`, `SESSION_COOKIE_*` and `CSRF_*` as one security group, not isolated knobs.",
