          "title": "Relationship fields",
          "body": "Relations are database constraints plus Python descriptors. Set `on_delete` and `related_name` deliberately.",
          "code": "author = models.ForeignKey(Author, on_delete=models.CASCADE, related_name=\"posts\")\nprofile = models.OneToOneField(User, on_delete=models.CASCADE, related_name=\"profile\")\ntags = models.ManyToManyField(Tag, blank=True, related_name=\"posts\")",
