      "quick_answer": "QuerySets are lazy. Use `filter`/`exclude`/`get`, `select_related` for FK/O2O, `prefetch_related` for M2M/reverse, `annotate` for per-row calculations and `aggregate` for one-row summaries. Call `.explain()` when a query is slow.",
