        "form prefix",
        "empty form",
        "validation hooks"
      ],
      "summary": "The forms API in one place: field types, widgets, form methods, formset management and the validation order.",
      "quick_answer": "A field validates and converts; a widget renders. Use `is_valid()` before `cleaned_data`, render `field.errors` and `non_field_errors`, and always include `management_form` for a formset.",
