      "summary": "The Django Template Language tags and filters you will actually use, plus the loader/context settings that affect every render.",
      "quick_answer": "Use `{% extends %}` for layout, `{% include %}` for fragments, `{% url %}` for links, `{% static %}` for assets and `{% csrf_token %}` in POST forms. Output is autoescaped; `|safe` is an explicit trust decision.",
